<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n46029" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἑωθῐνός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ή</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἕως</span> (A)) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>in the
				morning, early</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁ ἥλιος ὁ
			ἑ</span>. <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				3.104
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἑωθινὸς εἶδον στρατόν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					502
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὔσης . . ἐκκλησίας ἑ</span>.
				<i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Ach.</u>
				20
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πότοι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Bato
					5.3
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ ἑ.</span>, as Adv.,
				<i>early in the morning</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
			</span></i> l. c., <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
			</span></i>
			<i>Aër.</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				6
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐξ ἑωθινοῦ,</span>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἕωθεν</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Th.</u>
				2
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Phdr.</u>
				228b
			</span></i>, etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐξ ἑ. μέχρι δείλης</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>HG</u>
					1.1.5
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὐθὺς ἐξ ἑ</span>. <i><span class="en">
				Alex.
				257.4
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περὶ τὴν ἑ. φυλακήν</span>
			about the <i>morning</i> watch, <i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				3.67.2
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπὸ τὴν ἑ</span>. (alone)
				ib.<i><span class="en">
				43.1
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				LXX
				<u>1 Ma.</u>
				5.30
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἑ. φυλακῆς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					<u>Pomp.</u>
					68
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προσειπεῖν τὸ ἑ</span>. to wish
			one <i>good morning</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Laps.</u>
				1
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Macho
			</span></i> ap.<i><span class="en">
				Ath.
				13.580d
			</span></i> (dub. l.); <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἑ. δίκαι</span>, prov.
			for <i>business soon transacted,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				AB
				258
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>eastern</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔθνος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.P.
					697
				</span></i>
			: 
				Comp.
			 -<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ώτερος</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Str.
				11.2.2
			</span></i>: 
				Sup.
			 -<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ώτατος</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Id.
				4.5.1
			</span></i>.</div>
